# Build context is the repo root; keep it small and secret-free.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/cdk.out
**/coverage
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/prisma/generated

# Never ship real secrets into the build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.test

**/*.db
**/*.log
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
